# Runtime log dirs — anchored/explicit. A bare `logs/` matches a "logs" dir at
# ANY depth and swallowed SOURCE packages named "logs" (backend/app/cqrs/logs,
# packages/.../live_protocol/logs). The rsync-based deploy sync does NOT honor
# gitignore `!` negation, so we must not rely on a negation to rescue them.
/logs/
.redeploy/logs/
.koru/logs/
pendrive/logs/
reports/**/logs/
backend/logs/
backend/db/logs/
